	(descr "Lumberg 1502 08, 3.5mm stereo (TRS) jack, vertical/upright, THT, no switch, M6x0.5 threaded bushing (4.5mm) with knurled nut for panel mounting, round Ø8 body 11.8mm tall (PCB-to-panel), solder eyes 6.4mm long. Drawn from Lumberg datasheet 1502_08 (07/2025) and the Lumberg STEP (necks 1.8 x 0.3 at x=±2.65, 2.0 x 0.3 at y=2.5); slots 2.6 x 0.8 / 2.8 x 0.8 per sheet. Origin = plug axis. Lumberg pins: 1=S 2=T 3=R (T/R inferred from Lumberg numbering convention — verify). Farnell 4218067.")
